Copyright 2026 Kunal Raha

This repository is a derivative of Graphify
(https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify), extended with the IntentGraph
subsystems: persistent memory archive, associative memory graph, hybrid and
adaptive retrieval, evidence verification, context packets, MCP agent tools,
the Nebius/NVIDIA/Tavily provider integrations, and memory visualization.

